    {
      "id": "clm:e39db62f4cc1c74fb5d33ca56415fb1edd1dc52ce8395c5b14495794dcd8a2c7",
      "text": "The FDA prescribing information for DATSCAN (ioflupane I 123 injection), revised 11/2022, indicates it as an adjunct to other diagnostic evaluations for striatal dopamine transporter visualization using single photon emission computed tomography (SPECT) brain imaging in adult patients with suspected parkinsonian syndromes or suspected dementia with Lewy bodies. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-27)",
